{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27119","headline":"投江州张郎中 · 周贺","name":"投江州张郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"要地无闲日，仍容冒谒频。\n借山年涉闰，寝郡月逾旬。\n驿径曾冲雪，方泉省涤尘。\n随行溪路细，接话草堂新。\n减药痊余癖，飞书苦问贫。\n噪蝉离宿壳，吟客寄秋身。\n链句贻箱箧，悬图见蜀岷。\n使君匡岳近，终作社中人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}